                                                "example_id": "4206395e-794b-49c7-9bbf-271fd1033911",
                                                "sense_id": "819fb419-59aa-3347-8d63-71659481a791",
                                                "text": "My brother is a Wisconsinite; I'm Floridian."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4ebe4ff-3b6a-4237-8308-1d8521b01a28",
                                                "sense_id": "819fb419-59aa-3347-8d63-71659481a791",
                                                "text": "For the two Wisconsinites, it was the type of victory that might be appreciated in these parts, an intense struggle that was defined by inelegant offense and whose most memorable moment came when players on both teams flopped to the floor after a loose ball like Packers linebackers diving on a fumble."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8c40751a-f582-49c8-86da-87d05156721c",
                                                "sense_id": "819fb419-59aa-3347-8d63-71659481a791",
                                                "text": "“We look forward to offering every Wisconsinite the opportunity to vote for people, planet and peace over profit,” Dave Schwab, the secretary of the Wisconsin Green Party, said in a statement."
